<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-MUNICH MEN'S SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MUNICH MEN'S SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the $425,000 Munich men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding): Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Marc Rosset (Switzerland) 6-3, 6-1  </p>
<p>8-Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) 7-5 7-5</p>
</text>
